755 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 400 0 R
/E (Key innovations that enable DQN's success include the use of neural networks for function approximation, allowing it to handle high-dimensional state spaces efficiently. Additionally, techniques like Experience Replay \(storing and sampling past experiences\) and Target Networks \(a separate, delayed network for generating target Q-values\) are crucial for stabilizing the learning process and preventing divergence.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
