1067 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 415 0 R
/E (The benefits of actor-critic methods stem from this synergistic interaction: they achieve lower variance compared to pure policy gradient methods \(because the critic helps stabilize the policy updates by providing a more reliable baseline for reward estimation\) and are generally more stable than pure value-based methods \(as they learn a direct policy rather than relying solely on value function approximation for action selection\).)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [8]
>>
